# get_fruit_info
**Type:** tool
**Module:** packages.haive-tools.src.haive.tools.tools.fruityvice_tool
**Class:** StructuredTool

## Description
Fetch nutrition and detailed information about a specific fruit using its name from the Fruityvice API

## Schema
